  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21c508f2611e2e05",
      "translationZh": "嗨，r/LocalLLaMA 的各位！我刚刚发布了 PromptDeck v1.1.0，想在这里分享一下，因为这个社区基本上就是它诞生的原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdde8c20e5e42271",
      "translationZh": "它是什么：一个用于并排向 LLM 提交提示词并进行基准测试的开源桌面工作室（Tauri + React）。一切都在本地运行——没有遥测，也不会调用云端，除非你明确添加了云端密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "789a08d4fb271116",
      "translationZh": "你可以用它做什么：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f518b4f61c72d654",
      "translationZh": "⚡ 用同一个提示词同时运行最多 4 个模型（Ollama、LM Studio、llama.cpp），并实时观看它们的流式输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a84c77921e46c18",
      "translationZh": "📊 用图表比较 TPS / TTFT（当服务器不报告用量时，~ 表示估算的 TPS）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69ee00735fbcff31",
      "translationZh": "🧪 测试套件——向多个模型提交 1–10 个提示词，获得记录各模型获胜次数的计分板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72e7ab3e6b42831f",
      "translationZh": "☁️ v1.1 新增：云端服务提供商——OpenRouter、Groq、DeepSeek、Together、OpenAI、xAI、Kimi、NVIDIA NIM、Ollama Cloud、Gemini + 自定义端点。按服务提供商选择模型，在同一次运行中混用本地和云端模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "253ea48a233e1697",
      "translationZh": "🏆 获胜者投票 + 持久化排行榜、差异视图、本地 SQLite 中的历史记录，以及 PDF/Markdown/CSV 导出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11529229463005d4",
      "translationZh": "🌑 浅色 / 深色 / AMOLED 主题，EN/DE/FA 语言区域设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96d091497dd48a37",
      "translationZh": "从 Releases 下载二进制程序（Windows / macOS / Linux）——或运行 npm run tauri dev，从源码启动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b008e7011d01168",
      "translationZh": "坦诚说明一些局限：云端 API 密钥目前存储在本地存储中（迁移到操作系统钥匙串已列入路线图），而云端运行的费用跟踪功能尚未实现。非常欢迎提交问题和 PR——我为新手保留了一批标记为 good first issue 的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdb66f0ff350b5f6",
      "translationZh": "很乐意回答问题——如果你做了什么有趣的基准测试，我也很想看看成绩榜！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b53de87b13a3b373",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Clear_Ear3550 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
